async function loadReports(){try{const from=$('#fromDate')?.value||'';const to=$('#toDate')?.value||'';const qs=(from?'?from='+encodeURIComponent(from):'')+(to?(from?'&':'?')+'to='+encodeURIComponent(to):'');const d=await api('/api/reports'+qs);const s=d.summary||{};const cards=$$('#page-reports .cards article span');if(cards[0])cards[0].textContent=s.total||0;if(cards[1])cards[1].textContent=s.completed||0;if(cards[2])cards[2].textContent=s.pending||0;if(cards[3])cards[3].textContent=s.cancelled||0;const sum=$$('#page-reports .summary-row b');if(sum[0])sum[0].textContent=d.popular?.service||'—';if(sum[1]){sum[1].textContent=Number(d.average_wait_minutes||0)+' मिनट';}if(sum[2])sum[2].textContent=(Number(s.total||0)?Math.round(Number(s.completed||0)*100/Number(s.total||0)):0)+'%';if(sum[3])sum[3].textContent='₹ '+Number(d.revenue||0).toFixed(2);const daily=d.daily||[];const svg=$('#reportChart');if(svg){const pts=daily.slice(-7);const max=Math.max(1,...pts.map(x=>Number(x.n||0)));const points=pts.map((x,i)=>{const px=30+(i*(640/Math.max(1,pts.length-1)));const py=210-(Number(x.n||0)/max)*160;return px.toFixed(1)+','+py.toFixed(1)}).join(' ');svg.innerHTML=pts.length?`<polyline points="${points}" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4"/>`+pts.map((x,i)=>{const px=30+(i*(640/Math.max(1,pts.length-1)));const py=210-(Number(x.n||0)/max)*160;return `<circle cx="${px}" cy="${py}" r="6"/>`}).join(''):'<text x="350" y="130" text-anchor="middle">कोई token data नहीं</text>';const xl=$('#reportLabels');if(xl)xl.innerHTML=pts.map(x=>`<span>${x.d}</span>`).join('');}}catch(e){toast(e.message)}}
async function loadDashboard(){try{const d=await api('/api/tokens');const all=d.tokens||[],today=new Date().toISOString().slice(0,10),t=all.filter(x=>(x.date||String(x.created_at||'').slice(0,10))===today);const unique=new Set(t.map(x=>x.mobile)).size;if($('#statTokens'))$('#statTokens').textContent=t.length;if($('#statCustomers'))$('#statCustomers').textContent=unique;if($('#statServices'))$('#statServices').textContent=services.length;const waiting=t.filter(x=>!['पूर्ण','रद्द','स्किप'].includes(x.status)).length;if($('#statWait'))$('#statWait').textContent=(waiting*3)+' मिनट';renderLive(t);if($('#adminCustomers'))$('#adminCustomers').textContent=unique;if($('#adminRequests'))$('#adminRequests').textContent=t.length;if($('#adminServices'))$('#adminServices').textContent=services.length;const completed=t.filter(x=>x.status==='पूर्ण').length;if($('#adminCompletion'))$('#adminCompletion').textContent=(t.length?Math.round(completed*100/t.length):0)+'%'}catch(e){toast(e.message)}}

async function loadServiceCharges(){
 const box=$('#serviceChargesRows'); if(!box)return;
 const saved=(await api('/api/service-charges')).charges||[];
 const map=new Map(saved.map(x=>[x.category+'||'+x.service,x]));
 const rows=[];
 const source=backendServiceCatalog.length?backendServiceCatalog:Object.entries(SERVICE_INFO).map(([category,v])=>({category,services:v.services||[]}));
 source.forEach(group=>(group.services||[]).forEach(svc=>{
   const cat=group.category, key=cat+'||'+svc.name, x=map.get(key)||{};
   const govtDefault=Number(String(svc.govt||'').match(/[₹]\s*([0-9]+(?:\.[0-9]+)?)/)?.[1]||0);
   rows.push({category:cat,service:svc.name,govt_fee:x.govt_fee??govtDefault,csc_fee:x.csc_fee??Number(svc.csc||0),other_fee:x.other_fee??0});
 }));
 box.innerHTML=rows.map((r,i)=>`<tr><td>${escapeHtml(r.category)}</td><td><b>${escapeHtml(r.service)}</b></td><td><input class="sc-govt" data-i="${i}" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" value="${r.govt_fee}"></td><td><input class="sc-csc" data-i="${i}" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" value="${r.csc_fee}"></td><td><input class="sc-other" data-i="${i}" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" value="${r.other_fee}"></td><td class="sc-total" data-i="${i}">₹${(Number(r.govt_fee)+Number(r.csc_fee)+Number(r.other_fee)).toFixed(2)}</td><td><button class="primary sc-save" data-i="${i}">Save</button></td></tr>`).join('');
 window._serviceChargeRows=rows;
 box.querySelectorAll('input').forEach(inp=>inp.oninput=()=>{const i=Number(inp.dataset.i),g=Number(box.querySelector(`.sc-govt[data-i="${i}"]`).value||0),c=Number(box.querySelector(`.sc-csc[data-i="${i}"]`).value||0),o=Number(box.querySelector(`.sc-other[data-i="${i}"]`).value||0);box.querySelector(`.sc-total[data-i="${i}"]`).textContent='₹'+(g+c+o).toFixed(2)});
 box.querySelectorAll('.sc-save').forEach(btn=>btn.onclick=async()=>{const i=Number(btn.dataset.i),r=window._serviceChargeRows[i],g=Number(box.querySelector(`.sc-govt[data-i="${i}"]`).value||0),c=Number(box.querySelector(`.sc-csc[data-i="${i}"]`).value||0),o=Number(box.querySelector(`.sc-other[data-i="${i}"]`).value||0);try{await api('/api/service-charges',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({category:r.category,service:r.service,govt_fee:g,csc_fee:c,other_fee:o})});toast('Charges saved: '+r.service)}catch(e){toast(e.message)}});
}
let _sopRows=[];
async function loadSopPage(){const cat=$('#sopCategory'),svc=$('#sopService');if(!cat||!svc)return;try{const d=await api('/api/sops');_sopRows=d.sops||[];const cats=[...new Set(_sopRows.map(x=>x.category))];cat.innerHTML=cats.map(x=>`<option>${escapeHtml(x)}</option>`).join('');const refresh=()=>{const rows=_sopRows.filter(x=>x.category===cat.value);svc.innerHTML=rows.map(x=>`<option value="${escapeHtml(x.service)}">${escapeHtml(x.service.split(' — ').slice(1).join(' — '))}</option>`).join('');const r=rows[0];if(r)fillSop(r)};const fillSop=r=>{svc.value=r.service;$('#sopDocs').value=(r.documents||[]).join('\n');$('#sopSteps').value=(r.steps||[]).join('\n');$('#sopNote').value=r.note||'';$('#sopChecks').innerHTML=(r.checks||[]).map((c,i)=>`<div class="form-row" style="margin:8px 0"><input class="sop-check-label" data-i="${i}" value="${escapeHtml(c.label||'')}" placeholder="Checklist item"><label><input class="sop-check-required" data-i="${i}" type="checkbox" ${c.required!==false?'checked':''}> Required</label></div>`).join('')||'<p class="muted">No custom checklist; generic review checklist लागू होगा।</p>'};cat.onchange=refresh;svc.onchange=()=>{const r=_sopRows.find(x=>x.service===svc.value);if(r)fillSop(r)};refresh();$('#checkSopPattern').onclick=()=>{const result=$('#sopPatternResult');const labels=[...document.querySelectorAll('.sop-check-label')].map(x=>x.value.trim()).filter(Boolean);const required=[...document.querySelectorAll('.sop-check-required')].filter(x=>x.checked);const docs=$('#sopDocs').value.split('\n').map(x=>x.trim()).filter(Boolean);const steps=$('#sopSteps').value.split('\n').map(x=>x.trim()).filter(Boolean);const dup=labels.filter((x,i,a)=>a.findIndex(v=>v.toLowerCase()===x.toLowerCase())!==i);const problems=[];if(!svc.value)problems.push('Service select नहीं है');if(!docs.length)problems.push('Required Documents खाली हैं');if(!steps.length)problems.push('SOP Steps खाली हैं');if(!labels.length)problems.push('Checklist item नहीं है');if(labels.length&&!required.length)problems.push('कम-से-कम 1 Required checklist item होना चाहिए');if(dup.length)problems.push('Duplicate checklist item: '+dup.join(', '));if(problems.length){result.textContent='❌ Pattern Invalid: '+problems.join(' · ');result.style.color='#b42318'}else{result.textContent='✅ Pattern Valid — '+labels.length+' checklist item(s), '+required.length+' required. SOP Save किया जा सकता है।';result.style.color='#16834b'}};$('#saveSop').onclick=async()=>{try{const checks=[...document.querySelectorAll('.sop-check-label')].map((el,i)=>({id:'check_'+(i+1),label:el.value.trim(),required:document.querySelector(`.sop-check-required[data-i="${i}"]`)?.checked!==false})).filter(x=>x.label);const r=await api('/api/sops',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({service:svc.value,documents:$('#sopDocs').value.split('\n').map(x=>x.trim()).filter(Boolean),steps:$('#sopSteps').value.split('\n').map(x=>x.trim()).filter(Boolean),note:$('#sopNote').value.trim(),checks})});toast('SOP saved: '+r.sop.service);loadSopPage()}catch(e){toast(e.message)}};$('#refreshSop').onclick=loadSopPage}catch(e){toast(e.message)}}
async function loadControl(){try{const [d,qc]=await Promise.all([api('/api/control-center'),api('/api/admin/quality-review')]);const k=d.kpis||{};[['ccTokens',k.tokens],['ccActive',k.active_tokens],['ccPay',k.pending_payments],['ccQC',k.qc_pending],['ccUnassigned',k.unassigned_tokens],['ccStaff',k.active_staff]].forEach(([id,v])=>{if($('#'+id))$('#'+id).textContent=v??0});$('#ccAlerts').innerHTML=(d.alerts||[]).map(a=>`<div class="notification ${a.severity==='high'?'unread':''}"><div class="nicon">${a.severity==='high'?'⚠️':'ℹ️'}</div><div><b>${escapeHtml(a.label)}</b><small>${escapeHtml(a.count)} item(s)</small></div></div>`).join('')||'<p class="muted">कोई pending alert नहीं।</p>';$('#ccOps').innerHTML=`<div class="summary-row"><span>Completed</span><b>${k.completed||0}</b></div><div class="summary-row"><span>Home pending</span><b>${k.home_pending||0}</b></div><div class="summary-row"><span>Open complaints</span><b>${k.open_complaints||0}</b></div>`;const rows=(qc.items||[]).filter(x=>x.token.quality_status!=='passed');$('#adminQualityRows').innerHTML=rows.length?rows.map(x=>`<tr><td><b>${escapeHtml(x.token.token)}</b></td><td>${escapeHtml(x.token.name)}</td><td>${escapeHtml(x.token.service)}</td><td>${escapeHtml(x.token.staff_id||'—')}</td><td>${escapeHtml(x.token.quality_status||'needs_review')}</td><td><button class="primary" type="button" data-qc-review="${x.token.id}">Review</button></td></tr>`).join(''):'<tr><td colspan="6">कोई pending Quality Review नहीं है।</td></tr>';document.querySelectorAll('[data-qc-review]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>adminQualityReview(Number(b.dataset.qcReview)));document.querySelector('#tokenWorkCenter')?.setAttribute('onclick',"(()=>{const id=Number(localStorage.getItem('angelCurrentTokenId')||0);if(id)openTokenWorkCenter(id);else toast('पहले current token चुनें')})()");}catch(e){toast(e.message)}}
async function openTokenWorkCenter(id){
  try{
    const [w,q,d]=await Promise.all([
      api('/api/token-workflow?token_id='+encodeURIComponent(id)),
      api('/api/service-quality?token_id='+encodeURIComponent(id)),
      api('/api/workflow/documents?token_id='+encodeURIComponent(id))
    ]);
    const t=w.token||q.token||{}; const wf=w.workflow||{}; const checks=(q.quality?.checks||q.sop?.checks||[]); const docs=d.documents||[];
    const modal=document.createElement('div'); modal.className='token-work-modal'; modal.id='tokenWorkCenterModal';
    const esc=escapeHtml;
    const opt=(v)=>['pending','received','verified','not_required'].map(x=>`<option value="${x}" ${String(v||'pending')===x?'selected':''}>${x==='pending'?'बाकी है':x==='received'?'मिल गया':x==='verified'?'सत्यापित':'लागू नहीं'}</option>`).join('');
    const checkRows=checks.length?checks.map(c=>`<label class="twc-check"><input type="checkbox" data-qc-id="${esc(c.id)}" ${c.checked?'checked':''}> <span>${esc(c.label)} ${c.required?'*':''}</span></label>`).join(''):'<p class="muted">इस service के लिए quality checklist configured नहीं है।</p>';
    const docRows=docs.length?docs.map(x=>`<div class="twc-doc"><div><b>${esc(x.name)}</b><small>${esc(x.mime_type||'')} · ${esc(x.status||'uploaded')}</small></div><div class="twc-doc-actions"><button type="button" class="btn" data-twc-open="${x.id}">Open</button><button type="button" class="btn success" data-twc-verify="${x.id}" ${x.status==='verified'?'disabled':''}>Verify</button><button type="button" class="btn danger" data-twc-reject="${x.id}" ${x.status==='verified'?'disabled':''}>Reject</button></div></div>`).join(''):'<p class="muted">इस token के लिए कोई document नहीं मिला।</p>';
    modal.innerHTML=`<div class="token-work-card token-work-center-card"><div class="token-work-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">ONE SCREEN WORKFLOW</span><h3>🧭 Token ${esc(t.token||'—')} — पूरा Work Center</h3><p>${esc(t.name||'—')} · ${esc(t.service||'—')} · <b>${esc(t.status||'—')}</b> · Staff: ${esc(t.staff_id||'—')}</p></div><button type="button" id="twcClose">×</button></div>
      <div class="twc-summary"><div><small>Token</small><b>${esc(t.token||'—')}</b></div><div><small>Customer</small><b>${esc(t.name||'—')}</b></div><div><small>Staff</small><b>${esc(t.staff_id||'Unassigned')}</b></div><div><small>Quality</small><b id="twcQualityBadge">${esc(t.quality_status||'needs_review')}</b></div></div>
      <div class="twc-section"><h4>1️⃣ काम की स्थिति</h4><div class="token-work-grid"><div class="token-work-item"><label>📷 Customer Photo</label><select id="twcPhoto">${opt(wf.photo)}</select></div><div class="token-work-item"><label>✍ Signature</label><select id="twcSignature">${opt(wf.signature)}</select></div><div class="token-work-item"><label>🪪 Required Documents</label><select id="twcDocuments">${opt(wf.documents)}</select></div><div class="token-work-item"><label>📤 Documents Upload</label><select id="twcUploads">${opt(wf.uploads)}</select></div><div class="token-work-item"><label>🔎 Data Cross-check</label><select id="twcData">${opt(wf.data)}</select></div><div class="token-work-item"><label>🧾 Application Submission</label><select id="twcSubmission">${opt(wf.submission)}</select></div><div class="token-work-item"><label>Reference / Application No.</label><input id="twcRef" maxlength="120" value="${esc(wf.reference_no||'')}" placeholder="ARN / Application / Receipt No."></div><div class="token-work-item"><label>Operator Notes</label><textarea id="twcNotes" maxlength="1000" placeholder="क्या काम हुआ / क्या बाकी है...">${esc(wf.notes||'')}</textarea></div></div><div class="token-work-actions"><button type="button" class="primary" id="twcSaveWork">💾 Work Details Save</button></div></div>
      <div class="twc-section"><h4>2️⃣ Documents Verification</h4><div class="twc-doc-list">${docRows}</div></div>
      <div class="twc-section"><h4>3️⃣ Final Quality Review</h4><p class="muted">पहले Quality Gate पूरा करें। <b>Checks Save</b> केवल save करेगा; <b>Final PASS</b> अलग approval action है।</p><div class="twc-gate" id="twcGateSummary"><div class="twc-gate-row"><span>Checklist</span><b>Loading…</b></div><div class="twc-gate-row"><span>Documents</span><b>Loading…</b></div><div class="twc-gate-row"><span>Payment</span><b>Loading…</b></div></div><div class="twc-check-list" id="twcChecks">${checkRows}</div><div class="twc-actions-row"><button type="button" class="primary" id="twcSaveQuality">☑️ Checks Save</button><button type="button" class="success" id="twcPass">✅ Final PASS</button><button type="button" class="danger" id="twcReject">❌ Reject / Correction</button></div></div>
      <div class="twc-section twc-final"><h4>4️⃣ Token Final Action</h4><p class="muted">Quality PASS होने के बाद यहीं से token Complete करें।</p><div class="twc-actions-row"><button type="button" class="success" id="twcStart">▶️ Start Work</button><button type="button" class="warning" id="twcHold">⏸️ Hold</button><button type="button" class="purple" id="twcComplete">🏁 Complete Token</button></div></div>
    </div>`;
    document.body.appendChild(modal);
    const close=()=>modal.remove(); modal.querySelector('#twcClose').onclick=close;
    const call=async(path,body)=>api(path,{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify(body)});
    const workBody=()=>({token_id:id,photo:modal.querySelector('#twcPhoto').value,signature:modal.querySelector('#twcSignature').value,documents:modal.querySelector('#twcDocuments').value,uploads:modal.querySelector('#twcUploads').value,data:modal.querySelector('#twcData').value,submission:modal.querySelector('#twcSubmission').value,reference_no:modal.querySelector('#twcRef').value.trim(),notes:modal.querySelector('#twcNotes').value.trim()});
    modal.querySelector('#twcSaveWork').onclick=async()=>{try{await call('/api/token-workflow',workBody());toast('Work details save हो गए');}catch(e){toast(e.message)}};
    const refreshQualityGate=async()=>{const r=await call('/api/service-quality',{token_id:id});const g=r.gate||{};const badge=modal.querySelector('#twcQualityBadge');if(badge)badge.textContent=g.ready?'READY FOR PASS':'GATE PENDING';const gate=modal.querySelector('#twcGateSummary');if(gate){const c=g.checklist||{},d=g.documents||{},p=g.payment||{};gate.innerHTML=`<div class=\"twc-gate-row\"><span>Checklist</span><b>${c.completed||0}/${c.required||0} ${c.ok?'✅':'❌'}</b></div><div class=\"twc-gate-row\"><span>Documents</span><b>${d.verified||0}/${d.required||0} ${d.ok?'✅':'❌'}</b></div><div class=\"twc-gate-row\"><span>Payment</span><b>${p.required?(p.verified?'Verified ✅':'Pending ❌'):'Not Required'}</b></div>`;}return r};
    modal.querySelector('#twcSaveQuality').onclick=async()=>{try{const checks=[...modal.querySelectorAll('[data-qc-id]')].map(el=>({id:el.dataset.qcId,checked:el.checked}));const r=await call('/api/service-quality',{token_id:id,checks,action:'save',notes:'Admin quality checks saved'});modal.querySelector('#twcQualityBadge').textContent=r.quality?.status||'admin_review';toast('Quality checks saved — Final PASS अलग action है');await refreshQualityGate();}catch(e){toast(e.message)}};
    modal.querySelector('#twcPass').onclick=async()=>{try{const checks=[...modal.querySelectorAll('[data-qc-id]')].map(el=>({id:el.dataset.qcId,checked:el.checked}));const r=await call('/api/service-quality',{token_id:id,checks,action:'pass',notes:'Admin final quality review'});if(r.quality?.status!=='passed')throw new Error('Quality PASS नहीं हुआ');modal.querySelector('#twcQualityBadge').textContent='passed';toast('Final Quality Review PASS हो गया');loadControl();}catch(e){toast(e.message)}};
    modal.querySelector('#twcReject').onclick=async()=>{const reason=prompt('Correction / Reject reason लिखें:','Quality check में correction जरूरी है');if(!reason)return;try{await call('/api/service-quality',{token_id:id,action:'reject',reason,notes:'Admin quality review'});toast('Quality Review rejected / correction required');close();loadControl();}catch(e){toast(e.message)}};
    modal.querySelector('#twcStart').onclick=async()=>{try{await call('/api/tokens',{id,action:'start'});toast('Work शुरू हो गया');close();loadTokens();}catch(e){toast(e.message)}};
    modal.querySelector('#twcHold').onclick=async()=>{const reason=prompt('Hold reason:','Customer/document pending');if(!reason)return;const mins=Number(prompt('Expected delay (minutes):','15')||0);if(!mins)return;try{await call('/api/tokens',{id,action:'hold',reason,owner:'customer',delay_minutes:mins});toast('Token Hold कर दिया गया');close();loadTokens();}catch(e){toast(e.message)}};
    modal.querySelector('#twcComplete').onclick=async()=>{try{await call('/api/tokens',{id,action:'complete'});toast('Token Complete हो गया');close();loadTokens();loadControl();}catch(e){toast(e.message)}};
    refreshQualityGate().catch(e=>toast(e.message));
    modal.querySelectorAll('[data-twc-open]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=async()=>{try{const r=await fetch('/api/documents/'+encodeURIComponent(b.dataset.twcOpen)+'/file',{headers:{Authorization:'Bearer '+localStorage.getItem('angelAccessToken')}});if(!r.ok)throw new Error('Document open failed');const blob=await r.blob();const u=URL.createObjectURL(blob);window.open(u,'_blank','noopener');setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(u),30000)}catch(e){toast(e.message)}});
    modal.querySelectorAll('[data-twc-verify]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=async()=>{try{await call('/api/documents/'+encodeURIComponent(b.dataset.twcVerify)+'/status',{status:'verified',note:'Verified by Admin'});toast('Document verified');close();openTokenWorkCenter(id);}catch(e){toast(e.message)}});
    modal.querySelectorAll('[data-twc-reject]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=async()=>{const note=prompt('Document reject reason:','Document readable/valid नहीं है');if(!note)return;try{await call('/api/documents/'+encodeURIComponent(b.dataset.twcReject)+'/status',{status:'rejected',note});toast('Document rejected');close();openTokenWorkCenter(id);}catch(e){toast(e.message)}});
  }catch(e){toast(e.message)}
}
async function adminQualityReview(id){openTokenWorkCenter(id)}
async function loadAdvancedReports(){try{const from=$('#fromDate')?.value||'',to=$('#toDate')?.value||'',q=(from?'?from='+encodeURIComponent(from):'')+(to?(from?'&':'?')+'to='+encodeURIComponent(to):'');const [d,sa,sp]=await Promise.all([api('/api/reports'+q),api('/api/reports/service'+q),api('/api/reports/staff'+q)]);const rows=sa.services||[];let old=$('#serviceAnalyticsTable');if(!old){const panel=document.createElement('div');panel.className='panel';panel.innerHTML='<h3>Service-wise Profitability</h3><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Service</th><th>Tokens</th><th>Completed</th><th>Completion</th><th>Collection</th><th>Official</th><th>Staff</th><th>Contribution</th></tr></thead><tbody id="serviceAnalyticsTable"></tbody></table></div>';$('#page-reports').appendChild(panel);old=$('#serviceAnalyticsTable')}old.innerHTML=rows.map(x=>`<tr><td>${escapeHtml(x.service)}</td><td>${x.tokens}</td><td>${x.completed}</td><td>${x.completion_rate}%</td><td>₹${Number(x.verified_collection).toFixed(2)}</td><td>₹${Number(x.official_fee).toFixed(2)}</td><td>₹${Number(x.staff_commission).toFixed(2)}</td><td><b>₹${Number(x.contribution).toFixed(2)}</b></td></tr>`).join('')||'<tr><td colspan="8">No service data</td></tr>';let st=$('#staffAnalyticsTable');if(!st){const panel=document.createElement('div');panel.className='panel';panel.innerHTML='<h3>Staff Performance</h3><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Employee</th><th>Assigned</th><th>Completed</th><th>Completion</th><th>QC Pass</th><th>QC Pending</th><th>Home</th><th>Delivery</th><th>Commission</th></tr></thead><tbody id="staffAnalyticsTable"></tbody></table></div>';$('#page-reports').appendChild(panel);st=$('#staffAnalyticsTable')}st.innerHTML=(sp.staff||[]).map(x=>`<tr><td>${escapeHtml(x.employee_id)}<br>${escapeHtml(x.name)}</td><td>${x.assigned}</td><td>${x.completed}</td><td>${x.completion_rate}%</td><td>${x.quality_passed}</td><td>${x.qc_needs_review}</td><td>${x.home_visits}</td><td>${x.deliveries}</td><td>₹${Number(x.commission).toFixed(2)}</td></tr>`).join('')||'<tr><td colspan="9">No staff data</td></tr>'}catch(e){toast(e.message)}}


async function loadMonitoring(){try{const [m,i]=await Promise.all([api('/api/admin/monitoring'),api('/api/admin/incidents')]);const open=m.incidents||[];if($('#monitorStatus')){$('#monitorStatus').textContent=m.ok?'HEALTHY':(open.some(x=>x.severity==='critical')?'CRITICAL':'WARNING');$('#monitorStatus').className=m.ok?'tag green':'tag red'}if($('#monitorOpen'))$('#monitorOpen').textContent=open.length;if($('#monitorBackup'))$('#monitorBackup').textContent=m.monitor?.backup?.overdue?'OVERDUE':'OK';if($('#monitorAlert'))$('#monitorAlert').textContent=m.alert_webhook_configured?'Configured':'Not configured';const checks=[['Database integrity',m.monitor?.integrity?.ok,m.monitor?.integrity?.ok?'OK':'Failed'],['Storage',m.monitor?.storage?.data_file?.ok,m.monitor?.storage?.data_file?.ok?'Available':'Unavailable'],['Persistence',m.monitor?.storage?.persistence_configured,m.monitor?.storage?.persistence_configured?'Configured':'Missing'],['Backup',!m.monitor?.backup?.overdue,m.monitor?.backup?.overdue?'Overdue':'OK']];$('#monitorChecks').innerHTML=checks.map(x=>`<div class="notification"><div><b>${x[0]}</b><small>${x[2]}</small></div><span class="tag ${x[1]?'green':'red'}">${x[1]?'PASS':'CHECK'}</span></div>`).join('');const rows=i.incidents||[];$('#incidentRows').innerHTML=rows.map(x=>`<tr><td>${escapeHtml(x.type)}</td><td>${escapeHtml(x.severity)}</td><td>${escapeHtml(x.status)}</td><td>${escapeHtml(x.message||'')}</td><td>${escapeHtml(x.opened_at||'')}</td><td>${x.status==='open'?`<button class="primary resolve-incident" data-id="${x.id}">Resolve</button>`:'—'}</td></tr>`).join('')||'<tr><td colspan="6">No incidents</td></tr>';document.querySelectorAll('.resolve-incident').forEach(b=>b.onclick=async()=>{try{await api('/api/admin/incidents/resolve',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({id:Number(b.dataset.id)})});toast('Incident resolved');loadMonitoring()}catch(e){toast(e.message)}})}catch(e){toast(e.message)}}
async function loadSecurityAudit(){try{const d=await api('/api/admin/security-audit?limit=100');const c=d.counts||{};const ids={secLogin:'login_history',secFailed:'failed_login',secDocs:'document_access',secDownloads:'download_log',secDeletes:'delete_log',secPayments:'payment_verification',secTokens:'token_changes',secAdmin:'admin_activity',secStaff:'staff_activity',secPermissions:'permission_changes'};Object.entries(ids).forEach(([id,key])=>{if($('#'+id))$('#'+id).textContent=Number(c[key]||0)});const all=Object.values(d.logs||{}).flat().sort((a,b)=>String(b.at||'').localeCompare(String(a.at||''))).slice(0,100);const rows=$('#securityAuditRows');if(rows)rows.innerHTML=all.map(x=>{const rec=x.token_id?('Token '+x.token_id):x.application_id?('Application '+x.application_id):x.document_id?('Document '+x.document_id):x.payment_id?('Payment '+x.payment_id):x.staff_id?('Staff '+x.staff_id):'';return `<tr><td>${escapeHtml(x.at||'')}</td><td>${escapeHtml(x.action||'')}</td><td>${escapeHtml(x.by||x.employee_id||x.user||'')}</td><td>${escapeHtml(rec)}</td><td>${escapeHtml(x.reason||x.new_role||'')}</td></tr>`}).join('')||'<tr><td colspan="5">No audit records</td></tr>'}catch(e){toast(e.message)}}
async function loadPreflight(){try{const d=await api('/api/admin/preflight');const checks=d.checks||[];if($('#preflightPassed'))$('#preflightPassed').textContent=d.summary?.passed??0;if($('#preflightTotal'))$('#preflightTotal').textContent=d.summary?.total??checks.length;if($('#preflightStatus')){const ok=d.ok===true;$('#preflightStatus').textContent=ok?'READY':'ACTION NEEDED';$('#preflightStatus').className=ok?'tag green':'tag red'}const box=$('#preflightList');if(box)box.innerHTML=checks.map(x=>`<div class="notification"><div><b>${x.ok?'✓':'✗'} ${escapeHtml(x.label)}</b><small>${escapeHtml(x.detail||'')}</small></div><span class="tag ${x.ok?'green':'red'}">${x.ok?'PASS':'CHECK'}</span></div>`).join('')}catch(e){toast(e.message)}}

async function loadPageData(page){try{if(page==='tokens'||page==='tokenmgmt'||page==='status')await loadTokens();if(page==='home'||page==='admin')await loadDashboard();if(page==='customers')await loadCustomers();if(page==='payments')await loadPayments();if(page==='livecontent')await loadLiveOffersAdmin();if(page==='charges')await loadServiceCharges();if(page==='sop')await loadSopPage();if(page==='settings')await loadBackups();if(page==='preflight')await loadPreflight();if(page==='monitoring')await loadMonitoring();if(page==='control')await loadControl();if(page==='business')await window.angelLoadBusinessManagement?.();if(page==='security')await window.angelLoadSecurityAudit?.();if(page==='workflow')await window.angelLoadWorkflowConfig?.();if(page==='custom-services')await window.angelLoadCustomServices?.();if(page==='reports'){await loadReports();await loadAdvancedReports();}}catch(e){toast(e.message)}}
function clock(){const d=new Date();if($('#liveDate'))$('#liveDate').textContent=d.toLocaleDateString('hi-IN',{day:'2-digit',month:'long',year:'numeric'});if($('#clock'))$('#clock').textContent=d.toLocaleString('hi-IN',{dateStyle:'medium',timeStyle:'short'});if($('#liveClock'))$('#liveClock').textContent=d.toLocaleTimeString('en-IN',{hour:'2-digit',minute:'2-digit'});setTimeout(clock,1000)}
$('#fullscreenBtn')?.addEventListener('click',()=>$('.live-board')?.requestFullscreen?.());
// Customer business history is rendered by customer.html from backend APIs. Admin app does not keep a second local business-state store.
async function boot(){
  const isAdmin=document.body?.dataset.panel==='admin';
  try{
    // Admin navigation must be bound before any network-dependent initialization.
    // This keeps every data-page/data-open button usable even when the backend is temporarily unavailable.
    if(isAdmin){
      role='admin';
      $('#app')?.classList.add('hidden');
      $('#adminAuth')?.classList.remove('hidden');
      applyRoleAccess();
      bindAdminNavigation();
    }
    await loadServiceCatalog();
    renderServices();
    renderPublicServices();
    bindPublicServiceCards();
    clock();
    syncCustomerServiceControls();
    if(isAdmin){
      if(localStorage.getItem('angelAccessToken')) await verifyAdminSession();
    }else{
      role='customer';
      currentUser=null;
      updateCustomerButton();
      applyRoleAccess();
      const saved=localStorage.getItem('angelCustomerLocal');
      if(saved){try{currentCustomer=JSON.parse(saved);fillCustomer(currentCustomer);updateCustomerButton();syncCustomerServiceControls()}catch{}}
    }
  }catch(e){
    console.error('boot error',e);
    if(isAdmin){
      // Keep the Admin UI interactive even if a non-critical boot step fails.
      applyRoleAccess();
      bindAdminNavigation();
      $('#adminAuth')?.classList.remove('hidden');
    }
    renderPublicServices();
    bindPublicServiceCards();
  }
}
boot();
